Package: ravenwavcut
Title: Cut WAV Files Based on Raven Selection Tables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Neil", "Anderson", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "n.anderson@ncl.ac.uk")
Description: Takes a folder of WAV files and a folder of Raven Pro selection
    tables (tab-delimited TXT files) with matching file prefixes, and extracts
    each selection as a separate WAV file into an output folder. Output files
    are named after the source WAV file with a zero-padded numeric suffix
    (_01, _02, _03, etc.) corresponding to the selection number.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
